msgstr "Momentálne nie sú priradené žiadne skratky prehrávania."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/qml/ShortcutsStep.qml:202
msgid "Find the full list in the menu."
msgstr "Úplný zoznam nájdete v menu."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/qml/SubtitleLanguagesStep.qml:43
msgid "Choose the languages of your subtitles."
msgstr "Vyberte jazyky titulkov."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/qml/SubtitleLanguagesStep.qml:56
msgid ""
"Subtitles in your language show by themselves: from the video, from a file "
"next to it, or found online. When there are none in it, not even online, the "
"second language is used."
msgstr ""
"Titulky vo vašom jazyku sa zobrazia samy: z videa, zo súboru vedľa neho "
"alebo nájdené online. Keď v ňom žiadne nie sú, ani online, použije sa druhý "
"jazyk."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/qml/SubtitleLanguagesStep.qml:74
msgid "Default language"
msgstr "Predvolený jazyk"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/qml/SubtitleLanguagesStep.qml:93
msgid "Second language (when there are none)"
msgstr "Druhý jazyk (keď žiadne nie sú)"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/qml/SubtitleLanguagesStep.qml:122
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsSubtitleLanguages.qml:102
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsDialog.qml:583
msgid "Find subtitles online when a video has none in these languages"
msgstr "Hľadať titulky online, keď video nemá titulky v týchto jazykoch"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/qml/SubtitleLanguagesStep.qml:135
msgid ""
"Online subtitles come from free services (OpenSubtitles, and more for some "
"languages). Change all of it in Settings, Subtitles."
msgstr ""
"Online titulky pochádzajú z bezplatných služieb (OpenSubtitles a pre "
"niektoré jazyky aj ďalších). Všetko môžete zmeniť v Nastaveniach, Titulky."

